	"tips": "・Skilled Labor visa is for foreigners engaged in **work requiring specific skills**\n\n・Covers chefs, sports instructors, animal trainers, pilots, ship operators, etc.\n\n・Check the latest application requirements at the [Immigration Services Agency](https://www.moj.go.jp/isa/)\n\n・Requires **10+ years of work experience** (for chefs, etc.) or national qualifications/licenses\n\n・Skill certification documents from the employing company are crucial",
